WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.044 --> 00:00:04.421
What's the matter, miss?

00:00:04.796 --> 00:00:06.756
You look like you might have an inkling.

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:08.258
I don't.

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:10.635
No need to get cross.

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:11.928
Just leave me be.

00:00:12.804 --> 00:00:15.265
You'll be in Neo Xianglong for a while,
right?

00:00:16.057 --> 00:00:18.393
We're still looking for new recruits.

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:21.396
You'll get no royal treatment,
but the pay is good.

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:24.566
It's not money I'm after.

00:00:25.233 --> 00:00:27.068
Looks like we got rejected, commander.

00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:30.155
Not to worry. I've still got hope.

00:00:30.238 --> 00:00:33.074
Well, power to you.
Doesn't matter to me though.

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:36.619
An attack from above?

00:00:39.831 --> 00:00:41.458
It wasn't a missile strike?

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:44.794
Analysis of the
transport plane's logs revealed

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:48.339
that it was attacked at 12,000 meters.

00:00:49.674 --> 00:00:53.011
That's far beyond the range
of any anti-aircraft missile.

00:00:53.803 --> 00:00:58.016
Hey, Leon. Why don't you hold off
on the mahua for a while?

00:00:58.767 --> 00:01:02.479
He's always been like that,
snacking during class all the time.

00:01:02.937 --> 00:01:04.355
So, what are you saying?

00:01:04.981 --> 00:01:06.775
The attacker was most likely...

00:01:07.442 --> 00:01:09.319
a giant flying BRAI.

00:01:10.028 --> 00:01:10.862
Giant?

00:01:11.529 --> 00:01:12.530
So, a birdie?

00:01:13.281 --> 00:01:17.619
Normally, there's a limit to the weight
of flying animals.

00:01:18.203 --> 00:01:21.623
An aerial BRAI large enough
to tear apart a transport plane

00:01:21.831 --> 00:01:23.458
defies the laws of physics.

00:01:24.125 --> 00:01:27.462
Could it have one of those
Dark Drives in it?

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:33.343
If so, it could be amplifying its lift by
dispersing it across multiple dimensions.

00:01:33.676 --> 00:01:37.138
Their evolution is far beyond
what we imagined.

00:01:38.223 --> 00:01:43.019
It's called the absolute-defense system,
but it's weak against attacks from above.

00:01:43.311 --> 00:01:46.731
I've said it before,
but your budget priorities are crazy.

00:01:46.815 --> 00:01:49.818
-Shouldn't measures be--
-You don't need to say it.

00:01:49.859 --> 00:01:51.986
Be prepared just in case it happens.

00:01:53.655 --> 00:01:55.240
They just keep coming.

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:57.158
It never seems to stop.

00:01:57.492 --> 00:02:00.161
It's been a few years since
the BRAI appeared.

00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:02.330
Due to the evolutionary fields,

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:04.999
they've evolved at an astounding pace.

00:02:06.167 --> 00:02:09.504
It's as if they've undergone
several billion years of evolution

00:02:09.546 --> 00:02:11.589
all in a single bound.

00:02:12.507 --> 00:02:14.676
Only humans have been left behind.

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:18.179
Even if that's so, we still have to live.

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:21.182
They're the ones that must be culled.

